  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://cf.way2muchnoise.eu/versions/1172382.svg\" alt=\"title\" width=\"169\" height=\"25\"></p>\n<div><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Forge-blue?style=plastic&link=https://files.minecraftforge.net/net/minecraftforge/forge/\" alt=\"Static Badge\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/NeoForge-lime?style=plastic&link=https://neoforged.net/\" alt=\"Static Badge\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Fabric-yellow?style=plastic&link=https://fabricmc.net/\" alt=\"Static Badge\"></div>\n<p>&nbsp;<br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Этот мод позволяет использовать любые монеты из <a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/numismatics\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create : Numismatic</a> в <a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bountiful\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bountiful</a>&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/DevDyna/ContentArchive/blob/main/Create Numismatic Bounties/screen/base.png?raw=true\" alt=\"image\" width=\"784\" height=\"366\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Также данный проект по-прежнему полностью совместим с <a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/extra-bounties\" rel=\"nofollow\">Extra Bounties</a></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
